<details class="notation-legend">
    <summary>Journal notation</summary>
    <ul role="list">
        <li><JournalMarker State="OccurrenceState.Open" /></li>
        <li><JournalMarker Type="Task" State="OccurrenceState.Open" /></li>
        <li><JournalMarker Type="Thought" State="OccurrenceState.Open" /></li>
        <li><JournalMarker State="OccurrenceState.Done" /></li>
        <li><JournalMarker State="OccurrenceState.Moved" /></li>
        <li><JournalMarker State="OccurrenceState.Abandoned" /></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Symbols describe occurrences, not actions. Moved entries keep their own history.</p>
    <p class="journal-meta">Task and thought are notebook conventions. This journal currently records both as items, without a separate type.</p>
</details>
